# Form dialogs and sheets

Mutation modals (create/edit/delete Dialog or Sheet with `useActionState`) must not dismiss while a submit is in flight, and must auto-close on success.

## Components and helpers

| Piece | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Pending dismiss guard | `@/hooks/use-pending-aware-open-change` → `usePendingAwareOpenChange` |
| Auto-close on success | `@/hooks/use-action-state-success` → `useActionStateSuccess` |
| Toasts | `@/hooks/use-action-state-toast` → `useActionStateToast` |

## When

- **Apply** to every mutation Dialog/Sheet and panel delete-confirm dialog that submits via `useActionState` (or equivalent pending flag).
- **Do not apply** to read-only details dialogs (view payment, log details, etc.).
- **Do not apply** to inline non-modal panel/auth forms (nothing to close).

## How

```tsx
import { usePendingAwareOpenChange } from "@/hooks/use-pending-aware-open-change";
import { useActionStateSuccess } from "@/hooks/use-action-state-success";
import { useActionStateToast } from "@/hooks/use-action-state-toast";

const isPending = isActionPending || isTransitionPending;
const handleOpenChange = usePendingAwareOpenChange(isPending, onOpenChange);

useActionStateToast(state, isPending);
useActionStateSuccess(state, isPending, () => {
  onOpenChange(false);
});

<Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={handleOpenChange}>
  <DialogContent showCloseButton={!isPending}>
    {/* ... */}
    <Button
      type="button"
      variant="outline"
      onClick={() => handleOpenChange(false)}
      disabled={isPending}
    >
      Cancel
    </Button>
    <Button type="submit" disabled={isPending}>
      {isPending ? <InlineSpinner /> : null}
      Save
    </Button>
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

Same pattern for `Sheet` / `SheetContent`.

## Rules

While `isPending`:

- Block Escape, overlay click, X, and Cancel via `usePendingAwareOpenChange`.
- Hide the header close control: `showCloseButton={!isPending}`.
- Disable Cancel and submit buttons.

On success: close only through `useActionStateSuccess` (or server `redirect`).

On error: keep the modal open so field/form errors stay visible.

## Do not

- Wire `<Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={onOpenChange}>` on mutation forms — always use the pending-aware handler.
- Allow dismiss mid-submit via Escape, backdrop, or X.
- Auto-close on error.
